第1句 定义:An earthquake is a sudden shaking of the ground caused by …
第2句 危害:When a strong one strikes, it may …
第3句 成因:Most earthquakes happen where …
第4-5句 措施:Although we cannot stop them, we can … By …, people have a better chance of surviving.', 2, 'elective2', 'U4', 'sufe');

